329 0 obj
<<
/Title (Problem Statement A fitness center currently enrolls new members using a printed registration form at the front desk. This process is slow, makes member information difficult to manage, and does not provide a structured record of a member's fitness goals or medical conditions before training begins. Trainers also have no visibility into member preferences before the first session. The proposed low-code application replaces the paper process with a digital enrollment form. The form captures personal details, contact information, emergency contact, membership plan and type, fitness goals or medical notes, preferred activities, scheduling information, and health declaration in a structured format.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 299 0 R
/Prev 363 0 R
>>
endobj
